NOTE ON BUNDLED FONTS

This MIT license covers the source code in this repository. It does NOT cover
the font files in `public/fonts/`, which are third-party works by AJ (Jao
Kunheing / Nawone Sai), built and shared for the Shan community:

  - `aj12.ttf` — "AJ 12", Copyright (c) 2024 by Jao Kunheing
  - `aj00.ttf` — "A J Kunheing 00", JAO Kunheing (Nawone Sai)

Sources: https://ajfonts.netlify.app/ and https://shan-font-library.vercel.app/

See public/fonts/CREDITS.md for attribution and terms. If you reuse or
redistribute these fonts, keep the attribution and confirm terms with the
designer.
